The launcher failure is environmental, not a proof error: this Lean build resolves `/proc/<numeric-pid>/exe`, while the sandbox exposes only `/proc/self/exe` for the process namespace. I found the exact failing syscall path and am using a temporary runtime shim that redirects only that executable-path lookup; it does not alter the project, toolchain, dependencies, or theorem.
